ta-py=\"zhè\" data-defn=\"this; these\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">这</span><span class=\"tr\">這</span><rt>zhè</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"gè\" data-defn=\"classifier for people or objects in general\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">个</span><span class=\"tr\">個</span><rt>gè</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"cán jí rén\" data-defn=\"disabled person\" data-hsk=\"\"><span class=\"si\">残疾人</span><span class=\"tr\">殘疾人</span><rt>cán jí rén</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"shuō\" data-defn=\"to speak; to talk; to say\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">说</span><span class=\"tr\">說</span><rt>shuō</rt></ruby>：“<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"bù hǎo yì si\" data-defn=\"to feel embarrassed / to find it embarrassing / to be sorry (for inconveniencing sb)\" data-hsk=\"HSK 5;6\"><span class=\"si\">不好意思</span><span class=\"tr\">不好意思</span><rt>bù hǎo yì si</rt></ruby>，<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"nǐ\" data-defn=\"you\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">你</span><span class=\"tr\">你</span><rt>nǐ</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"shì\" data-defn=\"to be (followed by substantives only)\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">是</span><span class=\"tr\">是</span><rt>shì</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"yī\" data-defn=\"one / single / a (article)\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">一</span><span class=\"tr\">一</span><rt>yī</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"gè\" data-defn=\"classifier for people or objects in general\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">个</span><span class=\"tr\">個</span><rt>gè</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"shēng yì rén\" data-defn=\"businessman; business person\" data-hsk=\"\"><span class=\"si\">生意人</span><span class=\"tr\">生意人</span><rt>shēng yì rén</rt></ruby>，<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"wǒ\" data-defn=\"I; me; my\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">我</span><span class=\"tr\">我</span><rt>wǒ</rt></ruby><ru